#: src/routes/settings.tsx:2133
msgid "When enabled, first launch may use your system language if it is supported. Disabled by default so English remains the default language."
msgstr "启用时，首次启动可能会使用你的系统语言（如果支持）。默认禁用以保持英语为默认语言。"

#: src/routes/settings.tsx:1509
msgid "When enabled, funscripts with `range: 90` are normalized to `100` in memory so TheHandy playback keeps working."
msgstr "启用时，内存中 `range: 90` 的 Funscript 会被标准化为 `100`，以确保 TheHandy 播放正常工作。"

#: src/routes/settings.tsx:1571
msgid "When enabled, holding 'S' during the first 5 seconds of app startup will automatically enable SFW Mode. Useful for emergency situations."
msgstr "启用时，在应用启动的前 5 秒内按住 'S' 将自动启用 SFW 模式。适用于紧急情况。"

#: src/routes/settings.tsx:1399
msgid "When enabled, perks (not anti-perks) are applied immediately when received instead of being stored in inventory."
msgstr "启用时，增益（非反增益）在收到时会立即生效，而不是存入物品栏。"

#: src/routes/playlist-workshop.tsx:4030
msgid "When enabled, the anti-perk chance resets to its initial value after a round where an anti-perk was triggered."
msgstr "启用后，在触发反增益的回合后，反增益概率将重置为初始值。"

#: src/routes/playlist-workshop.tsx:3989
msgid "When enabled, the intermediary chance resets to its initial value after a round where intermediaries were triggered."
msgstr "启用后，在触发插入片段的回合后，插入片段概率将重置为初始值。"

#: src/routes/settings.tsx:8332
msgid "When enabled, the original cache folders will be removed after all files have been copied successfully. Keep this off if you want to verify the migration first."
msgstr "启用后，所有文件成功复制后将删除原始缓存文件夹。如果要先验证迁移，请保持关闭此选项。"

#: src/features/rounds/library/dialogs/EditRoundDialog.tsx:243
